		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Humanoid shape made of tangible darkness. No facial features. Sentient, ascetic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger (close/near) +1 (1d4) or 1 spell +2, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Entity</strong>. Doesn't need to eat or drink but can if desired.</p><p></p><p><strong>Misty Step (INT Spell)</strong>. Self. DC 12. Teleport up to near.</p><p></p><p><strong>Projectile (INT Spell)</strong>. DC 11. Hurl object at target within near, 1d4 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Telepathy</strong>. Mentally speak to sentient creatures within near.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
